  "title": "Doc arrives at McConnell",
  "description": "“Doc,” a WWII-era B-29 Superfortress, arrives in preparation for the Frontiers in Flight Air Show and Open House at McConnell Air Force Base, Kansas, Oct. 22, 2026. “Doc” is one of only two airworthy B-29 Superfortresses remaining in the world. The B-29 played a pivotal role in aviation history and represented the cutting edge of military technology in its era. McConnell hosts the air show every two years, opening the base for a free, two-day event allowing the public to see firsthand and up close how the Air Force operates.  (U.S. Air Force video by Senior Airman Amelio Brown)",
